# ============================================================================
# RS_VR_Weapons, VANILLA+ -- THE CHAINSAWS (WMSHEET.plus_chainsaws).
#
# The owner, 09-14: Vanilla+ is its own player class (New Game, choose class). Its versions of the Vanilla guns are
# NOT clones: each is its own gun, only this Weapon Card, starting from the Vanilla gun's numbers, to be tuned three at
# a time -- damage, fire rate, secondary fires. `model =` borrows the Vanilla gun's Model Card (the gun gets its own
# copy of it); the `class` block is the class writer's (_pending/tools/make_gun_classes.py), which writes the gun's
# ZScript class on every build. A number changed here changes only the Vanilla+ gun. Copied from WMSHEET.chainsaws,
# the weapons lane, 09-14.
# ============================================================================

# THE SET'S ONE EFFECT SWITCH (owner, 2026-10-03: "vanilla and v+ use ours or
# vanilla"). Off -- the default -- every gun here looks as it does today. On, each gun
# takes its `instead` block: a flash of light at the muzzle and nothing else.
# LOOK ONLY. WM_Sheet refuses a damage, rate-of-fire or alt-fire key inside an instead
# block by name, so this switch cannot move what any of these guns DO.
effectswitch = wm_vanilla_look

gun "WM_VP_Chainsaw"
  model                = WM_Chainsaw
  class
    slot               = 1
    selectionorder     = 2200
    ammo               = "Clip"
    hand               = main
    name               = "Chainsaw"
    pickupmessage      = "Chainsaw"
  end
  flashprofile         = "chainsaw"
  firetics             = 4
  fullauto             = true
  shotsaw              = true
  sawsounds            = "wm/saw/loop", "wm/saw/hit"
  firesfrom            = none
  spreadshape          = cone
  recoilprofile        = "chainsaw"
end

gun "WM_VP_ChainsawHeavy"
  model                = WM_ChainsawHeavy
  class
    slot               = 1
    selectionorder     = 9900
    ammo               = "Clip"
    hand               = off
    name               = "Heavy Chainsaw"
    pickupmessage      = "Heavy Chainsaw"
    upsound            = "wm/saw/start"
  end
  flashprofile         = "chainsaw_heavy"
  firetics             = 4
  fullauto             = true
  shotsaw              = true
  sawsounds            = "wm/saw/loop", "wm/saw/hit"
  sawpuff              = "RSB_SawPuffHeavy"
  firesfrom            = none
  spreadshape          = cone
  recoilprofile        = "chainsaw_heavy"
end
